      "inputTokens": 117,
      "outputTokens": 816,
      "costUsd": 0.0074025,
      "pronunciationText": "Here P r is the same one hundred and twenty, and one point zero zero six to the forty-eight is about one point three three. So M is one hundred and twenty times that power, over the power minus one, which is four hundred and eighty dollars seventy-eight cents, to the nearest cent. That's about eighty dollars more each month. But forty-eight of them add to about twenty-three thousand and seventy-seven dollars, about seven hundred and seventy dollars less than before. The debt is gone sooner, so there's less interest altogether."
